726870207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3009817834,"text":"花芸について、咲耶さんも深い見識を持っています。ただ、容彩祭に大勢の人が来ることを聞いた途端、少し緊張してしまったようです。こういった環境では、落ち着いて生け花ができないとか。","nextNodeIds":[726870208]},{"nodeId":726870208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2499178986,"text":"ですので、私が代わりに「咲耶の花屋」を皆さんに勧めています。","nextNodeIds":[726870209]},{"nodeId":726870209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2082577922,"text":"機会があったら、オイラたちも手伝ってやるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[726870219]},{"nodeId":726870219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1010027682,"text":"他に何か質問はありますか？","nextNodeIds":[726870220]},{"nodeId":726870220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3067219490,"text":"ありがとう、柴染さん。","nextNodeIds":[726870221]},{"nodeId":726870221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":139603770,"text":"いえ、どういたしまして。時間がありましたら、いつでも来てください。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726870210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1503724594,"text":"社奉行について…","nextNodeIds":[726870211]},{"nodeId":726870211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2797110330,"text":"社奉行は、これまで稲妻の花芸事業を支えてきてくれました。もっと言うと、今回の催しのために出資してくださった貴人は、まさにあの白鷺の姫君なのです。","nextNodeIds":[726870212]},{"nodeId":726870212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2496297666,"text":"白鷺の姫君は幼少の頃より、花芸に対して素晴らしい才を見せていました。私はあの方が花を生ける姿を見たことがあり、その心得についても語り合ったことがあります。","nextNodeIds":[726870213]},{"nodeId":726870213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1508383266,"text":"私のほうが年上ではありますが、生け花の技術も花芸に対する理解も、あの方には及びません。","nextNodeIds":[726870214]},{"nodeId":726870214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1416659450,"text":"状況が許す限り、白鷺の姫君は「生け花」の持つ芸術性を広めるため、資金を毎年提供してくれます。時には、自分の貯蓄を使うこともあるようです…","nextNodeIds":[726870215]},{"nodeId":726870215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2580369618,"text":"白鷺の姫君は、以前このように自分の胸の内を打ち明けたことがありました——「生け花」をより多くの人に知ってもらい、花芸に興味を持っていただいて、それに精通してほしいと。","nextNodeIds":[726870216]},{"nodeId":726870216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1890863482,"text":"綾華、稲妻の花芸のためにそんなに頑張ってたんだな…","nextNodeIds":[726870217]},{"nodeId":726870217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3694582458,"text":"彼女の願いが叶うといい。","nextNodeIds":[726870218]},{"nodeId":726870218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1842969362,"text":"ありがとうございます。お二方とも思いやりに溢れた方々なのですね。","nextNodeIds":[726870219]},{"nodeId":726870222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1782352058,"text":"もう大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[726870223]},{"nodeId":726870223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3508514954,"text":"時間がありましたら、いつでも来てください。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_IRODORI_FINISH_FLOWER_COMBINATION","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q72689"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7268904,"order":4,"stepDescription":"柴染と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":418573244,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7268902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_